<title>USA: Georgia Power to redeem class preferred.</title>
<headline>Georgia Power to redeem class preferred.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia Power Co said Tuesday it plans to redeem in full, on November 2, all outstanding shares of its $2.125 Class A Preferred Stock ($25.00 Stated Value) at the redemption price of $25.00 per share, plus accrued dividends to the date of redemption.</p>
<p>Georgia Power is a Southern Co subsidiary.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
